<title>MEXICO: Banca Promex says underwrites Vitro loan.</title>
<headline>Banca Promex says underwrites Vitro loan.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero Promex Finamex subsidiary, Banca Promex SA, said on Monday that it had restructured and placed a syndicated loan worth 975 million pesos for Vitro SA.</p>
<p>&quot;With this operation, Banca Promex will help Vitro SA to restructure its short term debts and extend them to a four-year term,&quot; Banca Promex said in a statement.</p>
<p>Banca Promex was the lead manager of the loan.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom (525) 728 9559</p>
</text>
